@startuml component
title 課堂搶答系統 元件圖（學習單匯入、Google 授權、搶答活動、寫回與匯出）
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"

actor "老師" as Teacher

node "老師的電腦（預設監聽 127.0.0.1，可用 BUZZER_HOST 設定）" {
  component "老師視窗\nteacher.html / teacher.js / api.js" as Browser
  component "各組視窗\nindex.html / student.js" as StudentBrowser
  component "登入指令\npython -m app google-login" as LoginCli

  node "FastAPI 伺服器（單一程序）" {
    component "API 路由\nteacher / worksheets / outputs" as Api
    component "搶答 API\nactivities / student" as ActivityApi
    component "推播中心\nHub（WebSocket /ws）" as Hub
    package "搶答活動 app/activity" {
      component "ActivityRegistry" as Registry
      component "ActivityEngine\n（每場一把 asyncio.Lock）" as Engine
      component "JoinLimiter" as JoinLimiter
      component "SqliteActivityRepository" as ActivityRepo
      component "SqliteResultSource" as ResultSource
    }
    component "身分與權限\nWindowRegistry / LoginLimiter / SessionStore" as Security
    component "學習單解析器\nparse_grid" as Parser
    component "預覽與學習單儲存\nPreviewStore / WorksheetStore" as Store
    component "寫回服務\nwrite_back" as Writeback
    component "CSV 匯出\nbuild_csv" as Csv
    interface "FinalResultSource" as ResultsPort
    component "Google 試算表存取層\nGoogleSheetsGateway" as Gateway
    component "OAuth 授權管理\nGoogleAuth" as Auth
  }

  database "SQLite\nbuzzer.db" as DB
  file "授權檔\ngoogle-token.json" as Token
  file "OAuth 用戶端設定檔\ngoogle-client-secret.json" as ClientSecret
}

cloud "Google" {
  component "Google Sheets API" as SheetsApi
  component "Google OAuth 2.0" as OAuth
}

actor "各組學生" as Student

Teacher --> Browser
Teacher --> LoginCli
Browser --> Api : HTTP（Authorization: Bearer）
Api --> Security
Api --> Parser
Api --> Store
Api --> Writeback
Api --> Csv
Api --> Gateway : 讀取試算表
Store --> DB
Writeback --> Parser : 重新解析驗證結構
Writeback --> Gateway : 讀取與寫入
Writeback --> ResultsPort
Csv --> ResultsPort
Student --> StudentBrowser
StudentBrowser --> ActivityApi : HTTP（X-Window-Id、Bearer）
StudentBrowser <--> Hub : WebSocket
Browser --> ActivityApi : HTTP（Bearer）
Browser <--> Hub : WebSocket
ActivityApi --> Security
ActivityApi --> JoinLimiter
ActivityApi --> Registry
ActivityApi --> Hub : 鎖釋放後推播事件
Registry --> Engine
Registry --> Store : 讀取已確認的學習單
Engine --> ActivityRepo : 結束時一次寫入
Registry --> ActivityRepo
ActivityRepo --> DB
ResultSource --> ActivityRepo
ResultSource ..> ResultsPort : 實作
Gateway --> Auth : 取得有效憑證
Gateway --> SheetsApi : HTTPS
Auth --> Token : 讀取／更新
Auth --> OAuth : 更新存取權杖
LoginCli --> ClientSecret
LoginCli --> OAuth : 授權（回呼 127.0.0.1）
LoginCli --> Token : 保存授權
@enduml
